        "source_sentence": "The tensile strength and the Young’s modulus of the polyamides (Table 2), ranging between 115 and 170 MPa and 2.8–5.1 GPa, respectively, can be considered as outstanding for unoriented polyamide films made by casting at a laboratory scale without any post-treatment."
