        "source_sentence": "Furthermore, benzimidazoles seem to be unique in this respect since homologous polyamides containing benzoxazole instead of benzimidazole moieties show a much lower affinity for water.<sup>26</sup> If the ratio benzimidazole/amide is considered, one can observe that, as a rule, the greater the density of benzimidazole groups, the greater is the ability to absorb water."
